WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
We were not stealing for ourselves!

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.340
Crimson Dawn?

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:09.660
Right.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:10.960
We run.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.680
I'm already a deserter.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:13.900
What's the difference?
